---
const steps = [
  {
    icon: 'M9 12l2 2 4-4m6 2a9 9 0 11-18 0 9 9 0 0118 0z',
    title: 'Book Your Consultation',
    description: 'No referral needed. Book directly with our board certified plastic surgeons online or by phone.'
  },
  {
    icon: 'M16 7a4 4 0 11-8 0 4 4 0 018 0zM12 14a7 7 0 00-7 7h14a7 7 0 00-7-7z',
    title: 'Meet Your Surgeon',
    description: 'Discuss your condition with our expert surgeons who will create a personalized treatment plan.'
  },
  {
    icon: 'M19.428 15.428a2 2 0 00-1.022-.547l-2.387-.477a6 6 0 00-3.86.517l-.318.158a6 6 0 01-3.86.517L6.05 15.21a2 2 0 00-1.806.547M8 4h8l-1 1v5.172a2 2 0 00.586 1.414l5 5c1.26 1.26.367 3.414-1.415 3.414H4.828c-1.782 0-2.674-2.154-1.414-3.414l5-5A2 2 0 009 10.172V5L8 4z',
    title: 'Same Day Surgery',
    description: 'In many cases, your procedure can be completed during your first visit with minimal scarring.'
  }
];
---

<section class="py-20 bg-white">
  <div class="container mx-auto px-4">
    <div class="text-center mb-16 animate-on-scroll">
      <h2 class="text-4xl font-serif font-bold mb-6">How We Started</h2>
      <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto">
        <p class="text-lg text-secondary-600 mb-6 leading-relaxed">
          Dr. Kunaal Jindal and Dr. Roberto Tutino are board certified plastic and reconstructive surgeons based in Toronto. Bonding over their shared passion for plastic and reconstructive surgery, these best friends recognized a significant gap in minor surgery care—specifically, long wait times and the lack of specialized minor surgery centers.
        </p>
        <p class="text-lg text-secondary-600 mb-8 leading-relaxed">
          Driven by a simple goal, they founded a modern, patient-focused clinic where skin lesions and other minor concerns could be treated quickly and effectively. Over the past five years, their vision has grown significantly. Today, TMSC operates four locations and boasts Ontario's largest expertise dedicated to minor skin and hand procedures.
        </p>
      </div>
    </div>
    
    <div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-3 gap-8 mb-16">
      {steps.map((step, index) => (
        <div class="text-center animate-on-scroll" style={`animation-delay: ${index * 0.1}s`}>
          <div class="w-20 h-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-primary-500 to-primary-600 rounded-2xl flex items-center justify-center mx-auto mb-6">
            <svg class="w-10 h-10 text-white" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width={2} d={step.icon} />
            </svg>
          </div>
          <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-secondary-900 mb-4">{step.title}</h3>
          <p class="text-secondary-600 leading-relaxed">{step.description}</p>
        </div>
      ))}
    </div>
    
    <div class="text-center animate-on-scroll">
      <p class="text-lg text-secondary-600 mb-6">
        Visit one of our clinics in Toronto, Oakville, Mississauga, or Vaughan to discuss your treatment goals.
      </p>
      <a href="/team" class="inline-flex items-center px-8 py-4 bg-gradient-to-r from-primary-600 to-primary-700 text-white rounded-full font-semibold transition-all duration-300 hover:shadow-xl hover:shadow-primary-500/25 hover:-translate-y-1 group">
        Learn More About Our Practice
        <svg class="w-5 h-5 ml-2 transition-transform duration-300 group-hover:translate-x-1" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
          <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M17 8l4 4m0 0l-4 4m4-4H3"></path>
        </svg>
      </a>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>